  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The contact sender and receiver do not exactly match the specified root bone.\n\nThe same is true for standard colliders (hands, fingers, etc.) set from the Avatar Descriptor.\n\nFor example, if Contacts' Overlay is enabled, a quick hand wave or controller input will appear to be followed by a one frame delay in position.",
